<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's doubles results at Wimbledon</p>
<p>on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>2-Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands)/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat</p>
<p>Marcos Ondruska (South Africa)/Grant Stafford (South Africa) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Third round:</p>
<p>9-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden)/Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) beat 8-Rick</p>
<p>Leach (U.S.)/Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 6-2 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>11-Neil Broad (Britain)/Piet Norval (South Africa) beat 6-Ellis</p>
<p>Ferreira (South Africa)/Patrick Galbraith (U.S.) 7-6 (7-5) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
<p>12-Donald Johnson (U.S.)/Francisco Montana (U.S.) beat Stephen</p>
<p>Noteboom (Netherlands)/ F. Wibier 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>7-Mark Philippoussis (Australia)/Patrick Rafter (Australia)</p>
<p>beat 10-Sandon Stolle (Australia)/Cyril Suk (Czech Republic) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>13-Martin Damm (Czech Republic)/Pavel Vizner (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>beat 4-Mark Knowles (Bahamas)/Daniel Nestor (Canada) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>2-Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands)/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat</p>
<p>Sander Groen (Netherlands)/Sasa Hirszon (Croatia) 7-6 (8-6) 6-4</p>
</text>
